OL,4,CChloe Mitchell killer had prior        
OL,5,Cparanoid schizophrenia diagnosis,      
OL,6,Ccourt told                             
OL,7,GThis article contains details that     
OL,8,Gsome may find distressing              
OL,10,FThe man accused of murdering Chloe     
OL,11,FMitchell was previously diagnosed with 
OL,12,Fparanoid schizophrenia, his defence    
OL,13,Fbarrister has told jurors.             
OL,15,FDes Fahy KC said Brandon Rainey        
OL,16,Faccepted that he killed Chloe but      
OL,17,Fwould rely on the partial defence of   
OL,18,Fdiminished responsibility.             
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
