OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CSecond man admits manslaughter of      
OL,5,Cchildren's nurse Karen Cummings        
OL,6,GA second man has pleaded guilty to the 
OL,7,Gmanslaughter of children's nurse Karen 
OL,8,GCummings.                              
OL,10,FGlenn Robert King, 34, whose address   
OL,11,Fwas given as HMP Magilligan, admitted  
OL,12,Fthe charge on Thursday.                
OL,14,FKaren Cummings, 40, who worked in      
OL,15,FDaisy Hill Hospital in Newry, was      
OL,16,Ffound unconscious with a serious head  
OL,17,Finjury in Laurel Heights in Banbridge, 
OL,18,Fin County Down, in December 2024.      
OL,20,FThe emergency services attended the    
OL,21,Fscene but she was pronounced dead a    
OL,22,Fshort time later.                 G2/4 
