OL,4,CUniversity 'looking into' street party 
OL,5,Cnear campus                            
OL,6,GA university says it is looking into   
OL,7,Gwhether students breached its code of  
OL,8,Gconduct after a street party close to  
OL,9,Gits campus in Londonderry.             
OL,11,FFootage on social media showed         
OL,12,Fhundreds of young people dancing in an 
OL,13,Falleyway in the Argyle Street area of  
OL,14,FDerry - close to Ulster University's   
OL,15,Fcampus in the city - on Wednesday      
OL,16,Fnight.                                 
OL,18,FPolice and the local community safety  
OL,19,Fwardens responded to reports of the    
OL,20,Fparty, although police said no one     
OL,21,Fcould be located in the area.          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
